      <body>
         <pb xml:id="leaf001r" facs="Yale/CD7/Whitman9.jpg" type="recto"/>
         <lg type="poem">
         
            <note type="authorial" place="top" hand="#h02" rend="underline">don't like this head line try again&#8211;</note>

            <head rend="italic" type="main-authorial">With Husky,<add place="below" hand="#h02"><metamark target="#a001" function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" hand="#h02"><metamark function="emphasize" target="#a001">/</metamark></add><add hand="#h02" place="above" xml:id="a001">&#11840;</add> Haughty Lips, O sea!</head>
   <delSpan rend="overstrike" hand="#h02" spanTo="#d001"/><milestone unit="undeclared" rend="short-center"/><anchor xml:id="d001"/><addSpan hand="#h02" spanTo="#a004"/><metamark function="delete" target="#d001">&#977;</metamark><anchor xml:id="a004"/>

            <l>With husky<del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02">,</del><add place="left" hand="#h02"><metamark function="emphasize" target="#a002">/</metamark></add><add hand="#h02" place="left" xml:id="a002">&#11840;</add><del rend="closeup"><seg> </seg></del>haughty lips, O <subst hand="#h02"><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">s</del><add place="right" seq="2" rend="marked">S</add></subst>ea!<add hand="#h02" place="below"><metamark function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="right" hand="#h02"><metamark function="emphasize">#</metamark></add></l>
            
            <l>Where day and night I wend thy surf-beat shore,</l>
            <l>Imaging to my sense thy varied strange suggestions<del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02">;</del><add place="right" hand="#h02"><metamark function="emphasize" target="#a005">/</metamark></add><add place="right" hand="#h02" xml:id="a005">,</add></l>
           
            <l>Thy troops of white-maned racers racing to the goal,</l>
            <l>Thy ample, smiling face, dash'd with the sparkling dimples of<lb/> the sun,</l>
            <l>Thy brooding scowl and murk—thy unloos'd hurricanes,</l>
            <l>Thy unsubdueness, caprices, wilfulness<add place="below" hand="#h02"><metamark function="add">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="left" hand="#h02"><metamark function="emphasize">#</metamark></add>;</l>
            <l>Great as thou art above the rest, thy many tears&#8212;a lack<lb/> from all eternity in thy content,</l>
            <l>(Naught <hi rend="overline underline" xml:id="j003">but the</hi> <hi rend="overline underline" xml:id="j002">gr</hi>eatest strug<hi rend="overline underline" xml:id="j001">gles</hi>, wrongs, defe<subst hand="#h02"><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">c</del><add place="above" seq="2">a</add></subst>ts, could make<lb/> thee greatest&#8212;no less could<metamark function="adjust" target="#j001 #j002 #j003"><hi rend="underline">&#65077;</hi></metamark> make thee,)</l>
            <note rend="circled" hand="#h02" type="authorial" place="left">defeats.</note>
            <l>Thy lonely state&#8212;something thou ever seek'st and seek'st, yet<lb/> never gain'st,</l>
            <l>Surely some right witheld&#8212;some voice<add place="below" hand="#h02"><metamark function="add" target="#a007">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="above" hand="#h02"><metamark function="emphasize" target="#a007">/</metamark></add><add place="above" hand="#h02" xml:id="a007">,</add> in huge monotonous<lb/> rage<add place="below" hand="#h02"><metamark function="add" target="#a006">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="left" hand="#h02"><metamark function="emphasize" target="#a006">/</metamark></add><add place="left" hand="#h02" xml:id="a006">,</add> of freedom-lover<subst hand="#h02"><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">,</del><add place="right" rend="marked" seq="2">pent,</add></subst></l>
            <l>Some vast heart, <add hand="#h02" place="left" rend="marked"><metamark function="delete" target="#d002">&#977;</metamark></add><del hand="#h02" rend="overstrike" xml:id="d002">pent</del> like a planet's, chain'd and chafing in<lb/> th<del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02">e</del>se <add hand="#h02" place="left"><metamark function="emphasize" target="#e001">/</metamark></add><add hand="#h02" place="left" xml:id="e001">o</add> breakers,</l>
               
            <l>By lengthen'd swell, and spasm, and panting breath<add hand="#h02" place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a008">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="right" hand="#h02"><metamark function="emphasize" target="#a008">/</metamark></add><add place="right" hand="#h02" xml:id="a008">,</add></l>   
            
            <l>And rhythmic rasping of thy sands and waves,</l>
            <l>And serpent hiss, and savage peals of laughter,</l>
            <l>And undertones of distant lion roar,</l>
            <l>(Sounding, appealing to the sky's deaf ear&#8212;but now<add hand="#h02" place="below"><metamark function="add" target="#a009">&#8248;</metamark></add><add place="right" hand="#h02"><metamark function="emphasize" target="#a009">/</metamark></add><add place="right" hand="#h02" xml:id="a009">,</add> rapport<lb/> for once,</l>
            <l>A phantom in the night thy confidant for once,)</l>
            <l>The first and last confession <retrace rend="overstrike" hand="#h02" cause="emphasize"><del rend="overstrike" hand="#h03">e</del></retrace><retrace hand="#h02" cause="emphasize"><add place="right" hand="#h03">o</add></retrace>f the globe,</l>
            <l>Out<subst hand="#h02"><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">ra</del><add place="left" seq="2">sur</add></subst>ging, muttering<del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02" xml:id="d004">,</del><add place="right" hand="#h02"><metamark function="delete" target="#d004">&#977;</metamark></add> from thy soul's abysms,</l>
            <note type="authorial" place="left" hand="#a002" rend="circled">outsurging</note>
            <l>The tale of cosmic elemental passion,</l>
            <l>Thou t<subst hand="#h02"><del rend="overstrike" seq="1">a</del><add place="left" seq="2">e</add></subst>llest <del rend="overstrike" hand="#h02">of</del><add place="below" hand="#h02"><metamark function="emphasize" target="#e002">/</metamark></add><add place="below" hand="#h02" xml:id="e002">to</add> a kindred soul.</l>
         </lg>
            <byline rend="right">W<hi rend="smallcaps">ALT</hi> W<hi rend="smallcaps">HITMAN</hi>.<add hand="#h02" seq="1"><del rend="overstrike" seq="2" xml:id="d005">&#8212;</del></add><add place="right" hand="#h02"><metamark function="delete" target="#d005">&#977;</metamark></add></byline> 
         
         
